## Why This Is Asked

Tests Linux networking, virtualization concepts, and QoS under multi-tenant load in a real-world VPN gateway.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant namespaces/VRF routing
- XDP/BPF for ACLs and QoS
- tc/qdisc HTB or fq_codel per tenant
- IRQ affinity and CPU pinning
- NUMA awareness and tenant cgroups
- Observability with iperf/netperf

